hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"178","Narrated to me Abu Khaythamah Ali bin Amr bin Khalid Al-Harrani, narrated to me by my father, narrated to me by Zuhayr, narrated by Al-A’mash, on the authority of Abu Salih, on the authority of Abu Hurairah, He said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “When you dress and when you perform ablution, start with your right hands.”"
